    f"  Durability.\n"
    f"- **Concurrency** = mean credit of the 3 standalone concurrency-safety capabilities\n"
    f"  (`concurrent_assignment_race_safety`, `concurrent_plan_mutation_race_safety`,\n"
    f"  `concurrent_capacity_exhaustion_race_safety`) -- each fires two genuinely concurrent requests\n"
